<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Chubu Elec shelf registration.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Chubu Elec shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp on Tuesday assigned a preliminary AA+ rating to Chubu Electric Power Co Inc's 730 billion yen shelf registration programme on the Japanese market.</p>
<p>This is a renewal of the 1.02 trillion yen shelf registration programme which expired on October 11, 1996, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, it said.</p>
</text>
